{"obsah":"<p>Our projects Trialshow.cz and Bikeskills.cz were invited to the opening of a luxury pump track in Brandýs.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>The main part of the programme was an exhibition by our team – Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček, Lukáš Valný and Matouš Balík – with guest Ondra Nenadál from our club.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>The workshop with coaching for kids and adults was run by Katarína Tóthová with the family teams of the Hlouchas and Kabeláčs and all the riders from our club who had a moment to come, cheer and ride.</p>\n\n<p>A nice turnout of spectators filled the pump track and the space around the obstacles. Everyone rode like their lives depended on it, and it was great to see kids and parents enjoying testing the pump track as well as our exhibition.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_1986.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_1986.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208739\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_1984.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_1984.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208738\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_1983.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_1983.webp?alt=media\" alt